{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"forEachComponentSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"W1","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reading"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"rType1"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"writing"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"wType1"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4SpanV","text":"Span"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s11MutableSpanV","text":"MutableSpan"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":">) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"rethrows"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R1"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"W1"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:12FirebladeECS9ComponentP","text":"Component"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reads 1 and writes 1 component type: ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" receives a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of the read type and an ","type":"text"},{"code":"inout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"MutableSpan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the written type. Within one call all spans have the same count and the same order: element ","type":"text"},{"code":"i","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"span belongs to the same member. The batches visit every member exactly once, in the iteration order of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"family.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["movers.forEachComponentSpan(reading: Velocity.self, writing: Position.self) { velocities, positions in","    for i in positions.indices { positions[i].x += velocities[i].dx }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Batches","anchor":"Batches","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sparse-set storage keeps every component type in its own dense array, so the components of the members of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"family are not necessarily next to each other in all arrays. The spans view the storage itself and nothing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"copied or allocated, so a batch is a maximal run of members whose components are consecutive in every involved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array. Entities that were created together and never had components removed form one big batch; after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"churn (removing components swap-removes) the batches get shorter, down to 1 element per call in the worst case."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Write "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"body"},{"text":" so that it is correct for any batch size, and do not rely on the number of calls.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The archetype storage keeps the columns of a table aligned, so it passes exactly one batch per table that matches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the family and has members, in table creation order. Entities with the same component set form one batch, however","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the component set came about, and a family whose members have several component sets gets several calls.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Rules","anchor":"Rules","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every type must be a required component of the family. The spans cannot escape ","type":"text"},{"code":"body","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"Span","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"~Escapable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"While the pass runs the nexus is locked like in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEach(reading:writing:_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": structural changes, reading a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written type through the nexus, writing a type twice, and writing a type that is read (or reading a written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"type) stop the process with a message.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A delegate subscribed to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask\/valueChanges","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" receives one ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentsModified","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" per written type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and call, not one event per batch.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(N) where N is the number of members, plus one hash lookup per component type."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Complexity","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Family\/forEachComponentSpan(reading:writing:_:)"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"title":"forEachComponentSpan(reading:writing:_:)","symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"each C"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Component"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"FirebladeECS","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"26.0","unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","introduc